{"sha": "a0c638a2f37bef8c343a2eb4d04c61b605a25def62b74ff2335bed99412629cd", "body": ["\\textbf{11.} 令 $t = u^2$，得 $\\Gamma(\\tfrac12) =", "\\int_0^\\infty t^{-1/2}\\eu^{-t}\\dd t =", "2\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-u^2}\\dd u = \\sqrt\\pi$。反复利用", "$\\Gamma(s+1) = s\\Gamma(s)$: $\\Gamma(k+1) = k!\\,\\Gamma(1) =", "k!$，并有", "\\[", "\\Gamma\\Bigl(k + \\frac32\\Bigr)", "= \\Bigl(k + \\frac12\\Bigr)\\Bigl(k - \\frac12\\Bigr)\\cdots", "\\frac12\\cdot\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac12\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{(2k+1)(2k-1)\\cdots1}{2^{k+1}}\\,\\sqrt\\pi .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{12.} 设 $F_n = \\pi^{n/2}/\\Gamma(\\frac n2 + 1)$。", "由于 $\\Gamma(\\frac n2 + 1) = \\frac n2\\,\\Gamma(\\frac n2) =", "\\frac n2\\,\\Gamma(\\frac{n-2}2 + 1)$，于是 $F_n =", "\\frac{2\\pi}nF_{n-2}$，与 $V_n$ 的递推相同（第", "5 题）。初值为 $F_1 = \\sqrt\\pi/\\Gamma(\\frac32) =", "\\sqrt\\pi/(\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2) = 2 = V_1$ 及 $F_2 =", "\\pi/\\Gamma(2) = \\pi = V_2$。由归纳法可得 $V_n = F_n$，对", "一切 $n$ 成立；第 11 题把它还原为", "第 6 题的两种闭式。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 令 $r = \\sqrt t$，则 $\\int_0^\\infty", "\\eu^{-r^2}r^{n-1}\\dd r = \\frac12\\int_0^\\infty", "t^{\\frac n2 - 1}\\eu^{-t}\\dd t = \\frac12\\Gamma(\\frac n2)$.", "于是", "\\[", "n\\,V_n\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-r^2}r^{n-1}\\dd r", "= V_n\\cdot\\frac n2\\,\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac n2\\Bigr)", "= V_n\\,\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac n2 + 1\\Bigr) = \\pi^{n/2} = I_n .", "\\]", "两边均已证明，该恒等式可以\\emph{理解}为", "高斯积分的壳层分解：半径为 $r$ 的球面", "面积为 $nV_nr^{n-1}$，而高斯", "权重 $\\eu^{-r^2}$ 沿各壳层积分。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $s_0 = V_1 = 2$（$0$ 维球面是两点），", "$s_1 = 2V_2 = 2\\pi$, $s_2 = 3V_3 = 4\\pi$, $s_3 = 4V_4 =", "2\\pi^2$，并有 $\\int_0^R s_{n-1}r^{n-1}\\dd r = V_nR^n =", "v_n(R)$：面积即体积关于半径的导数。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 设 $n = 2k$，由斯特林公式", "（见\\cref{thm:b2:comparison:stirling}）得 $k! \\sim", "\\sqrt{2\\pi k}\\,(k/\\eu)^k$，于是", "\\[", "V_{2k} = \\frac{\\pi^k}{k!}", "\\sim \\frac{(\\pi\\eu/k)^k}{\\sqrt{2\\pi k}}", "= \\frac1{\\sqrt{\\pi n}}\\Bigl(\\frac{2\\pi\\eu}n\\Bigr)^{n/2}", "\\qquad (n = 2k).", "\\]", "对奇数 $n$：$V_{2k+1} = 2W_{2k+1}V_{2k} \\leq 2V_{2k}$，于是", "比几何衰减更快的界同样成立（相差一个", "因子 $2$ 且指数平移一位） --- 对每个 $q >", "0$，$V_n = o(q^n)$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $V_2/4 = \\pi/4 \\approx 0.785$；$V_3/8 = \\pi/6", "\\approx 0.524$; $V_{10}/2^{10} = \\frac{\\pi^5}{120\\cdot1024}", "\\approx 0.0025$。一般地 $\\frac{V_n/2^n}{V_{n-2}/2^{n-2}}", "= \\frac{2\\pi}{4n} = \\frac{\\pi}{2n} \\to 0$：比值趋于", "$0$（比几何衰减更快）。内切球所占比例", "趋于零：立方体的体积集中到", "其顶点附近。", "", "\\textbf{17.} 由第 1 题，半径为 $1 -", "\\varepsilon$ 的内球体积为 $V_n(1-\\varepsilon)^n$，于是外层", "壳层所占比例为 $1 - (1 - \\varepsilon)^n \\to 1$。", "当 $n = 100$，$\\varepsilon = 0.01$ 时：$(0.99)^{100} =", "\\eu^{100\\ln0.99} \\approx \\eu^{-1.005} \\approx 0.366$：约", "$63\\%$ 的球体位于距其表面 $1\\%$ 以内。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $(W_n)$ 递减，故 $W_n \\leq W_{n-1} \\leq", "W_{n-2} = \\frac{n}{n-1}W_n$：夹逼，$W_{n-1}/W_n \\to 1$。", "乘以 $W_nW_{n-1} = \\frac\\pi{2n}$：$W_n^2 \\sim", "\\frac\\pi{2n}$，即 $W_n \\sim \\sqrt{\\pi/(2n)}$。下界：", "$W_n^2 \\geq W_nW_{n+1} = \\frac{\\pi}{2(n+1)}$，故 $W_n \\geq", "\\sqrt{\\pi/(2(n+1))}$ 对每个 $n$ 成立。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 分子：由 $1 - x^2 \\leq \\eu^{-x^2}$ 得 $(1 -", "x^2)^{\\frac{n-1}2} \\leq \\eu^{-(n-1)x^2/2}$，并令 $a =", "\\frac{n-1}2$,", "\\[", "\\int_\\delta^1(1 - x^2)^{\\frac{n-1}2}\\dd x", "\\leq \\int_\\delta^\\infty\\eu^{-ax^2}\\dd x", "\\leq \\int_\\delta^\\infty\\frac x\\delta\\,\\eu^{-ax^2}\\dd x", "= \\frac{\\eu^{-a\\delta^2}}{2a\\delta}", "= \\frac{\\eu^{-(n-1)\\delta^2/2}}{(n-1)\\delta}.", "\\]", "分母：由第 18 题，$2W_n \\geq \\sqrt{2\\pi/(n+1)}$。", "相除即得上面的界。取 $\\delta =", "s/\\sqrt{n-1}$，此时上式化为", "$\\sqrt{\\tfrac{n+1}{2\\pi(n-1)}}\\;\\eu^{-s^2/2}/s = O\\bigl(", "\\eu^{-s^2/2}/s\\bigr)$，关于 $n$ 一致：在带状区域", "$\\abs{x_1} \\leq s/\\sqrt{n-1}$ 之外几乎没有体积，当", "$s$ 适当大时 --- 由对称性，对", "每个方向同样成立。", "", "\\textbf{20.} 两个结论并不矛盾，因为它们刻画的是", "同一点的不同侧面。几乎每个点", "$B_n(1)$ 的范数接近 $1$（第 17 题：径向", "集中于球面附近），然而它的 $n$ 个", "坐标都很小，量级为 $1/\\sqrt n$（第 19 题），", "这与 $n$ 个大小为 $1/\\sqrt n$ 的坐标", "范数量级为 $1$ 是相容的。高维体积集中在", "所有坐标均分范数预算之处 ---", "靠近球面，但远离每个坐标轴的极点。", "", "\\textbf{21.} 取 $\\Delta_n$ 在 $x_n = t \\in \\intcc01$ 处的", "截面为 $\\{x' \\in \\R^{n-1} : x_i \\geq 0,\\ \\sum x_i \\leq 1 -", "t\\} = (1-t)\\Delta_{n-1}$，体积为", "$(1-t)^{n-1}\\operatorname{vol}(\\Delta_{n-1})$，由齐次性。", "于是", "\\[", "\\operatorname{vol}(\\Delta_n) =", "\\operatorname{vol}(\\Delta_{n-1})\\int_0^1(1 - t)^{n-1}\\dd t =", "\\frac{\\operatorname{vol}(\\Delta_{n-1})}{n}", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\operatorname{vol}(\\Delta_n) = \\frac1{n!}\\,.", "\\]", ""]}